{"3650330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ice Cream Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3650330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ICE CREAM SHOP SIMULATOR</strong><br>Open your dream ice cream shop in a bustling seaside resort and prepare for delicious chaos! Manage every aspect, from crafting artisanal ice cream to satisfying unpredictable and incredibly demanding customers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/aeea3ee3c4f2723a9e45e8f60af74efe.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/aeea3ee3c4f2723a9e45e8f60af74efe.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/aeea3ee3c4f2723a9e45e8f60af74efe.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME AN ICE CREAM MASTER</strong><br>Take orders, mix fresh ingredients, cook bases, churn your ice cream to perfection, and create colorful cones with different flavors and toppings! Don't forget creamy milkshakes for the most discerning palates and much more. Every detail counts to win over your customers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/722bc292c742140feb7334bc51f93549.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/722bc292c742140feb7334bc51f93549.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/722bc292c742140feb7334bc51f93549.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE AND EXPAND YOUR EMPIRE</strong><br>Give your shop a unique touch! Customize the decor, choose the most extravagant decorations, and expand your space to welcome more and more ice cream lovers. Manage stock, order new ingredients, and grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/4ecee3f0216f7b5fece3ad4f884835fd.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/4ecee3f0216f7b5fece3ad4f884835fd.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/4ecee3f0216f7b5fece3ad4f884835fd.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE CRAZY CUSTOMERS (EVEN IN CO-OP!)</strong><br>Every customer has an explosive personality and absurd requests. Serve them at your best, solo or by unleashing delirium in online co-op for up to 6 players! Laughter and friendly arguments guaranteed as you try not to mess everything up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/d2501ca4982a9f6fc1c2720b9566672a.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/d2501ca4982a9f6fc1c2720b9566672a.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/d2501ca4982a9f6fc1c2720b9566672a.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NON-STOP CHAOS ON THE COAST</strong><br>Your ice cream shop is the center of a vibrant world. Explore, decorate, and prepare for a relentless flow of hilarious situations. Ice cream is just the beginning of your worries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/3b018b9d612418756c6ca6fa99c5983d.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/3b018b9d612418756c6ca6fa99c5983d.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/3b018b9d612418756c6ca6fa99c5983d.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ICE CREAM SHOP SIMULATOR</strong><br>Open your dream ice cream shop in a bustling seaside resort and prepare for delicious chaos! Manage every aspect, from crafting artisanal ice cream to satisfying unpredictable and incredibly demanding customers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/aeea3ee3c4f2723a9e45e8f60af74efe.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/aeea3ee3c4f2723a9e45e8f60af74efe.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/aeea3ee3c4f2723a9e45e8f60af74efe.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME AN ICE CREAM MASTER</strong><br>Take orders, mix fresh ingredients, cook bases, churn your ice cream to perfection, and create colorful cones with different flavors and toppings! Don't forget creamy milkshakes for the most discerning palates and much more. Every detail counts to win over your customers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/722bc292c742140feb7334bc51f93549.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/722bc292c742140feb7334bc51f93549.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/722bc292c742140feb7334bc51f93549.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE AND EXPAND YOUR EMPIRE</strong><br>Give your shop a unique touch! Customize the decor, choose the most extravagant decorations, and expand your space to welcome more and more ice cream lovers. Manage stock, order new ingredients, and grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/4ecee3f0216f7b5fece3ad4f884835fd.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/4ecee3f0216f7b5fece3ad4f884835fd.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/4ecee3f0216f7b5fece3ad4f884835fd.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE CRAZY CUSTOMERS (EVEN IN CO-OP!)</strong><br>Every customer has an explosive personality and absurd requests. Serve them at your best, solo or by unleashing delirium in online co-op for up to 6 players! Laughter and friendly arguments guaranteed as you try not to mess everything up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/d2501ca4982a9f6fc1c2720b9566672a.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/d2501ca4982a9f6fc1c2720b9566672a.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/d2501ca4982a9f6fc1c2720b9566672a.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NON-STOP CHAOS ON THE COAST</strong><br>Your ice cream shop is the center of a vibrant world. Explore, decorate, and prepare for a relentless flow of hilarious situations. Ice cream is just the beginning of your worries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/3b018b9d612418756c6ca6fa99c5983d.poster.avif?t=1787961209\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/3b018b9d612418756c6ca6fa99c5983d.webm?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650330/extras/3b018b9d612418756c6ca6fa99c5983d.mp4?t=1787961209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Open a seaside ice cream parlor... and discover ice cream is the least of your worries! Customize every detail; serve ice cream, milkshakes, slushies to unpredictable customers. Play solo or co-op (up to 6 players). Talking NPCs, wild situations. Chaos has a delicious new flavor now!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Fr